        {
            "jpName": "カワカミプリンセス",
            "enName": "Kawakami Princess",
            "jpText": "キングさん、ごきげんようですわよっ！\r\n本日も美しゅうお姿をごらんできて、\n最高にぶち上がりますですわ！！",
            "enText": "Greetings, King! What is up? Laying eyes on\nthine splendid visage today hath verily lifted\nmy vibes!!",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 3043806570104208299,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "キングヘイロー",
            "enName": "King Halo",
            "jpText": "？　カワカミさん？\r\n今日はいつも以上に言葉遣いが……。",
            "enText": "Um, Kawakami? You sound different today…",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 4413182592716101064,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "カワカミプリンセス",
            "enName": "Kawakami Princess",
            "jpText": "っ！　おわかりになられましたっ？",
            "enText": "Oh! I'm absolutely delighted you noticed!",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 6396193653016540524,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "カワカミプリンセス",
            "enName": "Kawakami Princess",
            "jpText": "私、さらに磨きをかけるべく、\r\nネットでも新たな知識を得てきましたの！",
            "enText": "In my quest to become more refined, I have\ngained new knowledge from the internet!",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": 6113842018627205360,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "カワカミプリンセス",
            "enName": "Kawakami Princess",
            "jpText": "このお勉強の成果は必ず1番にキングさんへ\r\nお伝えしようと思ってましたのよっ、ふふ♪",
            "enText": "I wanted thee to be the first to witness my\nlinguistic glow-up! Hehe!♪",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": -620310599853813086,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "キングヘイロー",
            "enName": "King Halo",
            "jpText": "……。",
            "enText": "…",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": -8455772105666884308,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "キングヘイロー",
            "enName": "King Halo",
            "jpText": "そうね。じゃあ私ともお勉強しましょうか。\r\nまずは謙譲語と尊敬語の違いから。",
            "enText": "Right. How about I give you some lessons?\nFirst, we'll learn how to choose the right\ndiction.",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": -4566895369420686127,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "カワカミプリンセス",
            "enName": "Kawakami Princess",
            "jpText": "まあっ、ぜひっ！\r\nとっても素敵な時間になりそうですわっ♪",
            "enText": "Yes, please! That would be indubitably fire♪",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
